<p>A <code>TreeListItem</code> is an <code>&lt;li role="treeitem"&gt;</code>.
  It can carry <code>aria-expanded</code> (for branches) and
  <code>aria-selected</code> (for the active item).</p>

<p>See the <a href="/components/tree-nav/">Tree Nav demo</a>
  for a composed example.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;TreeNav label="Clinical navigation"&gt;
  &lt;TreeList label="Departments"&gt;
    &lt;TreeListItem tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true"&gt;
      Cardiology
      &lt;ul role="group"&gt;
        &lt;TreeListItem tabindex="-1"&gt;
          &lt;TreeLink href="/cardiology/outpatients"&gt;Outpatients&lt;/TreeLink&gt;
        &lt;/TreeListItem&gt;
        &lt;TreeListItem tabindex="-1"&gt;
          &lt;TreeLink href="/cardiology/inpatients"&gt;Inpatients&lt;/TreeLink&gt;
        &lt;/TreeListItem&gt;
      &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/TreeListItem&gt;
    &lt;TreeListItem tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false"&gt;
      Oncology
    &lt;/TreeListItem&gt;
    &lt;TreeListItem tabindex="-1"&gt;
      &lt;TreeLink href="/radiology"&gt;Radiology&lt;/TreeLink&gt;
    &lt;/TreeListItem&gt;
  &lt;/TreeList&gt;
&lt;/TreeNav&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
{# END generated: examples #}
